4792" label="text-like">Mediant ofr accent with a preparatory</l><l xml:id="m-8d3d9b75-be1f-4f46-a6d0-23cb92a90b9c" facs="#m-893c348c-b62b-4c67-a865-15917382f608" label="ambiguous">Endings of1 accent witb 3 prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a1702c5-74e9-4f83-8b7b-b054269ae1f3" facs="#m-9e105894-5473-46ad-97b1-e0f9c88feae5" label="ambiguous">sllables.</l><l xml:id="m-458e8d71-fe30-4f0f-93e0-fc40d9e75916" facs="#m-1ba68039-a680-4e3b-a47c-f9fbacc76846" label="text-like">tory syllables (For the ending E. an</l><l xml:id="m-1596fd4c-3a60-4f12-a91e-7b14db37baad" facs="#m-0eb39d67-5775-4775-bf2f-29271700e401" label="lyrics-like">extra note is added in anticipãtion ot</l><l xml:id="m-e89db875-1258-4377-9ca4-8864938a1e17" facs="#m-79581001-6a4f-4510-8ca9-246bb759e38c" label="text-like">the accent in dactylic cadence¬)</l><l xml:id="m-bb6801e3-4e98-4897-822c-224f6329d49f" facs="#m-712fd4ec-c8e0-4b6e-967c-3b79f041dc8d" label="lyrics-like">1. Confi-tébor tibi Dómine in tó-to córde mé¬*in consi-li-o</l><l xml:id="m-5392d714-6d68-43d3-b663-84be36d124d3" facs="#m-6364fe95-9d72-441c-bef0-ebf229e362cb" label="ambiguous">— E</l><l xml:id="m-755af9b9-08ab-47c5-a7d6-169ac8fd94ba" facs="#m-6e16cd80-31ac-4075-bb0a-55f8f386f49d" label="lyrics-like">justórum et congregati¬ e. Flex : su-órum, j</l><l xml:id="m-10911f3b-29fa-4739-a454-fd1d60e99931" facs="#m-e450599f-58e2-4c4a-aeb8-d5c991a2d398" label="lyrics-like">1. Confitébor tibi Dómine in tóto côrde mé¬in consí-li-o</l><l xml:id="m-02e23ffd-d2a7-4b43-8615-b6565f9612d0" facs="#m-d20f06a6-6065-4898-8d07-19111c39db0c" label="ambiguous">4</l><l xml:id="m-695d8f9f-5657-4f20-baed-a48bcb037794" facs="#m-0e542439-7912-4c7a-ad82-993d12620baf" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-beb8d9ed-ef08-4ef1-9fbd-7f70feca164e" facs="#m-ea5451fe-e9e4-4263-b836-404083fe9292" label="lyrics-like">justórum et congregati-ô¬ ne. or: congrega-ti-ô- ne.</l><l xml:id="m-24eedbd8-acb7-4cbf-a9d2-e86d0107ad16" facs="#m-3fdd7203-a81e-4a96-9a7b-990ebd895cc8" label="lyrics-like">Fiex: su-órum, t</l><l xml:id="m-934ee6d9-0a29-4473-94a8-92dc357ac2ac" facs="#m-6153c68c-361b-4ad1-b0e9-fe56689bb9d8" label="lyrics-like">2. Mágna ópera Dómini : “exquisita in ómnes votuntátes éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-dca37b45-3357-4b70-9c8c-ff7beb529ad4" facs="#m-961baa9f-8838-42c6-b7f6-633ed1b89e5d" label="lyrics-like">3. Conféssio et magnificéntia ópus éjus: * et justitia éjus mánet in</l><l xml:id="m-53ada37e-d09a-4c51-aa6f-d35de5f4b5bb" facs="#m-0e711206-725c-4071-ae4c-cd7b18bb5b07" label="lyrics-like">séculum saéculi. (E: Saéeuli.)</l><l xml:id="m-8362532f-a029-4107-aa3d-d61aebfa468c" facs="#m-20ffc319-379f-4e91-9818-0ee262d6d406" label="lyrics-like">4. Memóriam fécit mirabilium suórum, t miséricors et miserátor</l><l xml:id="m-6e303f5d-64db-4abb-8713-5519970633f0" facs="#m-233aa270-8618-4cb5-990c-e4010aa4c523" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus::éscam dédit timentibus se.</l></lg>
